      "title": "CAPACITE: Boardroom Changes And CSR Structure Will Support Future Upside Potential",
      "body": "Analysts have trimmed their fair value estimate for Capacit'e Infraprojects from about ₹411 to ₹341, citing updated assumptions that combine more moderate revenue growth and a slightly higher discount rate with firmer profit margin expectations and a marginally lower future P/E. What's in the News A board meeting is scheduled for May 20, 2026 to consider and approve the audited standalone and consolidated financial results for the fourth quarter and full year ended March 31, 2026, and to address other matters including governance and CSR structure.",
